OL,3,GNEWSAOrkney island welcomes first baby
OL,4,Ain more than three decades
OL,5,
OL,6,FA baby has been born on Orkney's most
OL,7,Fnortherly island for the first time in
OL,8,Fmore than three decades.
OL,10,FParents Jorge Suarez and Alice Traill
OL,11,FFord welcomed baby Duncan Wilder
OL,12,FThorstein Traill Suarez Ford in North
OL,13,FRonaldsay last week.
OL,15,FIslanders toasted the birth with a dram
OL,16,Fof whisky to celebrate the first
OL,17,Fnewborn in the remote location since
OL,18,FThomas Brookman in August 1992.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
