OL,3,GNEWSAOrkney island welcomes first baby
OL,4,Ain more than three decades
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family, who split their time
OL,7,Fbetween Costa Rica and Orkney and
OL,8,Ftravelled more than 5,000 miles for the
OL,9,Fbirth, said Duncan was born in a
OL,10,Fmuch-loved place.
